# S Extension Policy — S Symbol Only (Owned Formats)

Rule: Har file jo S ecosystem KI HAI, uska identity S se shuru / S-branded.

## Owned by S (must use S symbol)

| Extension | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| .s        | Source code |
| .sd       | Design / spec / strategy docs |
| .se       | Project / package manifest |
| .stest    | Test files (optional) |
| .smod     | Packaged module archive name (future) |

## NOT owned (keep industry standard when interoperating)

| Extension | Why keep |
|-----------|----------|
| .json     | External tools / Hub wire format may still speak JSON |
| .kt       | Kotlin compiler output must stay .kt |
| .html/.js | Browsers require these for S Play host page |

## Naming law

1. New S docs → always .sd
2. New S programs → always .s
3. New S project config → prefer project.se
4. Never invent .py/.kt/.java for user S code
